-2.  **Parametric Definition:** Define the cubic Bézier curve $p(u)$ for $u \in [0, 1]$ using the Bernstein basis polynomials:
-    $$ p(u) = (1-u)^3 Q_0 + 3(1-u)^2 u Q_1 + 3(1-u) u^2 Q_2 + u^3 Q_3 $$
